01:14:40.506 --> 01:14:42.506
That sounds good.

107
01:14:43.506 --> 01:14:47.506
Jesus had spoken to them about the kingdom of God.

108
01:14:47.506 --> 01:14:54.506
And those disciples were completely wowed by what Jesus, the risen Lord, had told them.

109
01:14:54.506 --> 01:14:56.506
They had not actually recognized Jesus.

110
01:14:56.506 --> 01:15:01.506
Only when Jesus had given the bread of the kingdom of God...

111
01:15:01.506 --> 01:15:03.506
had they not recognized him.

112
01:15:03.506 --> 01:15:05.506
They had not recognized him.

113
01:15:05.506 --> 01:15:07.506
They had not recognized him.

114
01:15:07.506 --> 01:15:10.506
They had not actually recognized Jesus.

115
01:15:10.506 --> 01:15:15.506
