168
01:18:20.506 --> 01:18:25.506
Church, we must not claim what Jesus is according to our thoughts.

169
01:18:25.506 --> 01:18:29.506
Jesus says who he is, he says I am the I am.

170
01:18:29.506 --> 01:18:31.506
