182
01:19:09.506 --> 01:19:11.506
Across all times.

183
01:19:11.506 --> 01:19:14.506
To continue to move forward with humanity each time again.

184
01:19:14.506 --> 01:19:18.506
And we do not see it and we do not understand it and we do not do it.

185
01:19:18.506 --> 01:19:20.506
And we interpret something else.

186
01:19:20.506 --> 01:19:22.506
And we think that this is God.

187
01:19:22.506 --> 01:19:24.506
And in another part of the world, they say that this is God.

188
01:19:24.506 --> 01:19:28.506
And despite knowing who He is, we still do that and we do that.

189
01:19:28.506 --> 01:19:31.506
