Luke chapter 24, verse 44.

250
01:22:33.506 --> 01:22:38.506
He said to them, this is what I told you when I was still with you.

251
01:22:38.506 --> 01:22:46.506
Everything that is written about me in the books of Moses and the prophets and in the Psalms had to happen.

252
