02:16:10.506 --> 02:16:12.506
that you say here not...

1306
02:16:12.506 --> 02:16:14.506
then just forget it, I'm leaving again.

1307
02:16:14.506 --> 02:16:16.506
But that you say here...

1308
02:16:16.506 --> 02:16:17.506
have mercy on me.

1309
02:16:17.506 --> 02:16:18.506
I'm a sinner.

1310
02:16:18.506 --> 02:16:20.506
Do you understand what I mean?

1311
02:16:20.506 --> 02:16:23.506
Stay inside, says Jesus.

1312
02:16:24.506 --> 02:16:26.506
Verse 7.

1313
02:16:26.506 --> 02:16:28.506
But if you remain in me...

1314
02:16:28.506 --> 02:16:30.506
and my words remain in you...

1315
02:16:30.506 --> 02:16:32.506
pay attention to what is written here.

1316
02:16:32.506 --> 02:16:33.506
Beautiful promise.

1317
02:16:33.506 --> 02:16:37.506
You will receive everything you ask for.

1318
02:16:37.506 --> 02:16:40.506
How wonderful it is in the kingdom of God.

1319
02:16:40.506 --> 02:16:42.506
How wonderful it was in Eden.

1320
02:16:42.506 --> 02:16:44.506
They had everything.

1321
02:16:44.506 --> 02:16:46.506
They had everything.

1322
02:16:46.506 --> 02:16:48.506
If you remain in me...

1323
02:16:48.506 --> 02:16:51.506
you will receive everything you ask for.

1324
02:16:51.506 --> 02:16:52.506
Verse 8.

1325
02:16:52.506 --> 02:16:55.506
It honors my Father when much fruit grows from you.

1326
02:16:55.506 --> 02:16:58.506
It shows that you are my disciples...

1327
02:16:58.506 --> 02:17:00.506
of the kingdom of God.

1328
02:17:01.506 --> 02:17:03.506
Lastly...

1329
02:17:03.506 --> 02:17:05.506
Sorry, it is really too late.

1330
02:17:07.506 --> 02:17:09.506
The last is this.

1331
02:17:12.506 --> 02:17:15.506
The last category of the kingdom of God...

1332
02:17:17.506 --> 02:17:21.506
is that He does not want you to be saved.

1333
02:17:21.506 --> 02:17:25.506
He does not want you to come to repentance...

1334
02:17:25.506 --> 02:17:27.506
with some kind of...

1335
02:17:28.506 --> 02:17:30.506
Just wait.

1336
02:17:30.506 --> 02:17:32.506
Because here it is so annoying.

1337
02:17:32.506 --> 02:17:34.506
So just wait.

1338
02:17:34.506 --> 02:17:36.506
Eventually, this will come.

1339
02:17:36.506 --> 02:17:38.506
And then everything will be good.

1340
02:17:38.506 --> 02:17:40.506
It is not the kingdom of God...

1341
02:17:40.506 --> 02:17:42.506
what is meant for you.

1342
02:17:42.506 --> 02:17:44.506
He has called you...

1343
02:17:44.506 --> 02:17:46.506
to come in...

1344
02:17:46.506 --> 02:17:48.506
to be with Jesus...

1345
02:17:48.506 --> 02:17:51.506
to reign together with him.

1346
02:17:51.506 --> 02:17:55.506
For do you know how this earth can be restored?

1347
02:17:55.506 --> 02:17:57.506
Through the church of Jesus Christ.

1348
02:17:57.506 --> 02:18:00.506
Do you know how this earth can come to restoration?

1349
02:18:00.506 --> 02:18:02.506
A new heaven and a new earth?

1350
02:18:02.506 --> 02:18:04.506
Through the church of Jesus Christ.

1351
02:18:04.506 --> 02:18:07.506
Do you know when the moment was...

1352
02:18:07.506 --> 02:18:11.506
that earth and heaven came into contact again?

1353
02:18:11.506 --> 02:18:15.506
That was the moment when the cross reconnected.

1354
02:18:15.506 --> 02:18:17.506
But when we are always talking...

1355
02:18:17.506 --> 02:18:19.506
about the kingdom of God...

1356
02:18:19.506 --> 02:18:22.506
for Jesus was, during the time he was talking...

1357
02:18:22.506 --> 02:18:24.506
talking about, for example,...

1358
02:18:24.506 --> 02:18:26.506
how you could enter.

1359
02:18:26.506 --> 02:18:28.506
And then you see Nicodemus from...

1360
02:18:28.506 --> 02:18:30.506
yes, how, what, how?

1361
02:18:30.506 --> 02:18:32.506
Of Jesus who says...

1362
02:18:32.506 --> 02:18:34.506
a seed can only be a seed...

1363
02:18:34.506 --> 02:18:37.506
can only grow if it dies to itself.

1364
02:18:37.506 --> 02:18:39.506
That is coming in.

1365
02:18:39.506 --> 02:18:40.506
That is come in theology.

1366
02:18:40.506 --> 02:18:42.506
That must die.

1367
02:18:42.506 --> 02:18:43.506
You must be baptized.

1368
02:18:43.506 --> 02:18:45.506
You must give up your old life.

1369
02:18:45.506 --> 02:18:47.506
You cannot remain prideful...

1370
02:18:47.506 --> 02:18:48.506
and then think you can come in...

1371
02:18:48.506 --> 02:18:50.506
a seed must die to its own self.

1372
02:18:50.506 --> 02:18:54.506
And then that seed dies to enter the kingdom of God.

1373
02:18:54.506 --> 02:18:58.506
Dying to this earthly life to enter into Jesus.

1374
02:18:58.506 --> 02:19:01.506
And then here that seed comes to life again.

1375
02:19:01.506 --> 02:19:04.506
Great, isn't it? Resurrection theology.

1376
02:19:04.506 --> 02:19:06.506
And then you come to life here.

1377
02:19:06.506 --> 02:19:07.506
And then you grow here.

1378
02:19:07.506 --> 02:19:10.506
But not to grow just for the fun of it.

1379
02:19:10.506 --> 02:19:13.506
There is so much more that Jesus is explaining.

1380
02:19:13.506 --> 02:19:16.506
We will be one with Jesus...

1381
02:19:17.506 --> 02:19:21.506
to reign together with Him over a new heaven and a new earth.

1382
02:19:21.506 --> 02:19:25.506
We are the solution to the misery in this area.

1383
02:19:26.506 --> 02:19:30.506
And even today, Christians still say about this...

1384
02:19:33.506 --> 02:19:34.506
How is that supposed to happen?

1385
02:19:34.506 --> 02:19:36.506
Do you know why?

1386
02:19:36.506 --> 02:19:38.506
Because we do not see it yet.

1387
02:19:40.506 --> 02:19:41.506
It is still the case.

1388
02:19:41.506 --> 02:19:43.506
Through the Holy Spirit, we can grasp it.

1389
02:19:43.506 --> 02:19:45.506
The Bible clearly speaks about it.

1390
02:19:45.506 --> 02:19:47.506
This is how it will happen.

1391
02:19:47.506 --> 02:19:53.506
And still, it is elusive to us in one way or another.

1392
02:19:53.506 --> 02:19:57.506
Unless you are engaged through the Holy Spirit.

1393
02:19:57.506 --> 02:20:02.506
The Holy Spirit wants to make known to you who you are.

1394
02:20:02.506 --> 02:20:05.506
You were not born to be saved.

1395
02:20:05.506 --> 02:20:07.506
You were born to reign.

1396
02:20:07.506 --> 02:20:11.506
You were born to be a king and a priest, says Peter.

1397
02:20:11.506 --> 02:20:18.506
You were born to reign with Jesus in His kingdom as a king and as a priest.

1398
02:20:18.506 --> 02:20:20.506
Lastly, John chapter 20.

1399
02:20:20.506 --> 02:20:22.506
Then I will really conclude.

1400
02:20:22.506 --> 02:20:24.506
John chapter 20.

1401
02:20:42.506 --> 02:20:46.506
The disciples were then glad when they saw the Lord.

1402
02:20:46.506 --> 02:20:49.506
Jesus said to them again, I wish you peace.

1403
02:20:49.506 --> 02:20:51.506
Here he comes.

1404
02:21:04.506 --> 02:21:06.506
And here he comes.

1405
02:21:12.506 --> 02:21:14.506
Then it is also forgiven him.

1406
02:21:14.506 --> 02:21:21.506
If you do not forgive someone what he has done wrong, then it is also not forgiven him.

1407
02:21:21.506 --> 02:21:25.506
Why does John include the concept of forgiveness?

1408
02:21:25.506 --> 02:21:30.506
Because forgiveness is the highest authority in the Jewish people.

1409
02:21:30.506 --> 02:21:33.506
That is why they also crucified Jesus.

1410
02:21:33.506 --> 02:21:37.506
Because Jesus says to a paralyzed man, I forgive you your sin.

1411
02:21:37.506 --> 02:21:41.506
And then those people say, who does he think he is, that he can forgive sins?

1412
02:21:41.506 --> 02:21:43.506
Only God can say that.

1413
02:21:43.506 --> 02:21:47.506
That is why you see here that Jesus says, if you come into my kingdom,

1414
02:21:47.506 --> 02:21:52.506
you will have all power and authority over heaven and over earth.

1415
02:21:52.506 --> 02:21:54.506
Why? Because you are in Christ.

1416
02:21:54.506 --> 02:21:56.506
In the Word of God.

1417
02:21:56.506 --> 02:21:58.506
Born of water and spirit.

1418
02:21:58.506 --> 02:22:01.506
In the authority of the name of Jesus.

1419
02:22:01.506 --> 02:22:03.506
Shall we stand?

1420
02:22:04.506 --> 02:22:06.506
Have we learned something? I hope so.

1421
02:22:06.506 --> 02:22:08.506
That has really been a two-hour sermon.

1422
02:22:12.506 --> 02:22:14.506
Shall we close our eyes?

1423
02:22:18.506 --> 02:22:20.506
No, keep your eyes open for just a moment longer.

1424
02:22:22.506 --> 02:22:26.506
Because if I start praying now and then say something afterwards, you'll be heading for the soup.

1425
02:22:26.506 --> 02:22:27.506
I want to say something.

1426
02:22:27.506 --> 02:22:33.506
One of the things I am going to do next week is hold a special collection.

1427
02:22:33.506 --> 02:22:38.506
And that special collection is about one person in open church.

1428
02:22:38.506 --> 02:22:41.506
And I will tell you the details of that next week.

1429
02:22:41.506 --> 02:22:46.506
One of the things we do, reigning in God's kingdom,

1430
02:22:46.506 --> 02:22:53.506
is to bring about change from God's kingdom in this broken earth.

1431
02:22:53.506 --> 02:22:56.506
This is our calling at this moment.

1432
02:22:56.506 --> 02:22:58.506
This is what we must do.

1433
02:22:58.506 --> 02:23:04.506
We must, just like Tommy and Saskia, go out into the streets from God's kingdom,

1434
02:23:04.506 --> 02:23:07.506
to the Gentiles, to tell about the love of God.

1435
02:23:07.506 --> 02:23:11.506
One of the things, and that is why there is a very beautiful word,

1436
02:23:11.506 --> 02:23:18.506
that describes this work, this doing, has a beautiful name.

1437
02:23:18.506 --> 02:23:21.506
And we call that missions.

1438
02:23:21.506 --> 02:23:24.506
These are all missions.

1439
02:23:24.506 --> 02:23:29.506
Jesus was on a mission for 33 years.

1440
02:23:29.506 --> 02:23:32.506
The apostles had a mission.

1441
02:23:32.506 --> 02:23:35.506
Namely to proclaim the good news,

1442
02:23:35.506 --> 02:23:41.506
first in Jerusalem, Galilee, Judea, Aria, and then to all corners of the world.

1443
02:23:41.506 --> 02:23:42.506
To be on mission.

1444
02:23:42.506 --> 02:23:47.506
Next week I have a special mission that I want to present to you.

1445
02:23:47.506 --> 02:23:49.506
I want to hold a special collection for that.

1446
02:23:49.506 --> 02:23:53.506
This is not money for open church, because it goes out of open church.

1447
02:23:53.506 --> 02:23:56.506
Out of the world in.

1448
02:23:56.506 --> 02:24:00.506
And I hope that we all will bring bags of money with us,

1449
02:24:00.506 --> 02:24:03.506
for the mission in the name of Jesus.

1450
02:24:03.506 --> 02:24:05.506
I will tell you what it is next week.

1451
02:24:05.506 --> 02:24:06.506
It is going to be amazing.

1452
02:24:06.506 --> 02:24:07.506
I love it.

1453
02:24:07.506 --> 02:24:08.506
Can we close our eyes?

1454
02:24:08.506 --> 02:24:12.506
Dear Father in heaven, I thank you for your son Jesus Christ.

1455
02:24:12.506 --> 02:24:14.506
I thank you for your Word.

1456
02:24:14.506 --> 02:24:19.506
I thank you that your Word explains very precisely who you are,

1457
02:24:19.506 --> 02:24:21.506
and how your kingdom is structured.

1458
02:24:21.506 --> 02:24:23.506
And I want to bless everyone in this room,

1459
02:24:23.506 --> 02:24:26.506
that we will be in God's kingdom,

1460
02:24:26.506 --> 02:24:29.506
that we will remain in God's kingdom,

1461
02:24:29.506 --> 02:24:34.506
and that we will reign from God's kingdom as kings and priests.

1462
02:24:34.506 --> 02:24:36.506
For those people in open church,

1463
02:24:36.506 --> 02:24:39.506
who do not know who they are in God's kingdom,

1464
02:24:39.506 --> 02:24:42.506
I bless you in the name of Jesus,

1465
02:24:42.506 --> 02:24:45.506
that just like in Luke chapter 24 verse 45,

1466
02:24:45.506 --> 02:24:48.506
that Jesus will open your eyes,

1467
02:24:49.506 --> 02:24:52.506
and that you will begin to understand the kingdom of God.

1468
02:24:52.506 --> 02:24:55.506
I bless you in the name of Jesus, through the Holy Spirit,

1469
02:24:55.506 --> 02:24:58.506
that you will understand the kingdom of God,

1470
02:24:58.506 --> 02:25:00.506
and that you will live in it.

1471
02:25:00.506 --> 02:25:03.506
To the honor and glory of the Father.

1472
02:25:03.506 --> 02:25:05.506
In Jesus' name. Amen.

1473
02:25:05.506 --> 02:25:07.506
Thank you all for your time.

1474
02:25:07.506 --> 02:25:09.506
Have a nice Sunday.
